A||||35||Ferrari_cdn||What comments you get from your friends?||||6||
Z||000000||Ferrari_cdn||09-18-2001||06:43 PM||||From people that doesn't know much about Fieros?  So far 3 friends of mine saw my fiero and got in it.  (2 good friends and a girlfriend) Their first response when they saw it the first time: "Wow, thats small but cool!"<P>When I open the driver/passenger door, "Damn, the seat's low"<P>And when they sit in the seat, "**** , THATS COMFORTABLE!  I'll like this"  One of them said he could sleep in it.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>1984 2m4||||reg||6
Z||000001||sqoach||09-18-2001||07:36 PM||||Response I get from friends? "Get a real man's car." Of course, they just have pickups. I think I'll keep my fiero.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">          <BR>^^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^^<BR><LI><FONT SIZE="1">84 SE (FOR SALE)*SOLD(?)*<BR><LI>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR><LI>86 SC</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Urchin||09-18-2001||07:47 PM||||"Coffin on wheels" is used frequently.  <BR>And the occasional joke about throwing it in the back of their truck when it brakes down.  That one is somewhat funny  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/final.jpg"> <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
Z||000003||BlackDragon||09-18-2001||07:53 PM||||i get a lot of "rear engine? i bet its fast" and "whoa, wats that, it looks awesome" and from the few that know a little about cars i get "what caused those things to catch fire? the way you drive, you dont need anything that has any chance of catching fire"   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>WTB:CHEAP black standard fiero. no engine is fine, any model/condition gray interior is a plus. must have title||||reg||1
