Z||000005||Kasdan||09-18-2001||07:57 PM||||"What is that?"<BR>"Whered you get the money for a Ferrari?"<BR>"Isnt that on e of those cars that caught fire?"<BR>"Is that a Fiero?  Cool!"<P>------------------<BR>Tyler Morgan, 1986 GT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero21.jpg">         <BR>Power Steering, Holley Scoop<BR>Aim=FieroDriver1986||||reg||1
Z||000006||Mach10||09-18-2001||08:05 PM||||"A Fiero?!? My Firehawk could rip it a new corn-hole!"<BR>"Fiero? Looks nice but, huhuhuh... They catch fire!"<BR>"Bet THAT'S fun to drive in winter"<BR>"WHERE'S THE BACK SEAT?!? What are you going to do without a back seat?!?"<BR>"The only thing that car's good for is as a Motorcycle jump..."<BR>"Whoah! SWEET!"<BR>"Awesome ride, man! Is that a Pontiac!?!"<BR>"So you gonna grow a mullet, or what?"<BR>"I love those cars..."<BR>"v6? In that? No way..."<BR>"Toys R Us still selling parts for that thing?"<P>Those are MY favorite... Almost all of the responses are being made in fun. The response is usually positive.||||reg||10
Z||000007||Sleeper||09-18-2001||09:05 PM||||my friends call it a  "ricer pos"..."sell it, and buy an older car"..."why didn't you buy a Hot Rod?"...Etc, etc. but they are the average big headed V8 suckas, so i'll forgive them.<P>chicks, older car enthusiasts(late 20's and older) and some local import fools and did i mention hot chicks--dig it.   ||||reg||1
Z||000008||Master_Sushi||09-18-2001||09:16 PM||||Well most of my friends that know my car like it. I allways am told I should dump my 4 cyl though. With people I dont really know I hear things like "nice car", or "death trap" often. I have noticed anyone thats been in my fiero does comment on how cozy it is. I notice when im driving around I get allot of people looking at my car, mostly wondering what it is.<P>I will miss these things when I sell my car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">.<P>------------------<BR>88 Fiero Coupe...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mesopotamis_1.jpg"> ||||reg||7
