Z||000010||FieroMaster88||09-18-2001||09:59 PM||||Well...when I first got my car, it was a 4 cyl auto and everyone would trash on me because it was "slow, and would catch fire".  They told me "they handle like $HIT!"(all my friends are ricers)  After the V6 swap I could beat all of them.  Now I get respect.  It now has a spoiler too..so it looks better too.  Now everyone likes it, except the Mustang owners.  But they all have V6 stangs, so I can beat them <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">            <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6<BR>5 speed Isuzu trans<BR>AcCel 8mm wires<BR>rapid fire plugs<BR>custom intake with K&N filter.<BR>Soon to be 2" closer to the ground and have a turbo||||reg||1
Z||000011||Tigger||09-18-2001||10:59 PM||||"NICE CAR!"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>(A good sign she approves)<P>"Cute Car"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><BR>Yea... whatever<P>"Hey, is that for sale?"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"><BR>Guy yelling out of his truck on the street - before lowering<P>"Look Daddy, I'm taller than this one!"<BR>Little kids at shows - after lowering<P>"Uhh... you know what...?"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> <BR>*Friend puts hand down on ground after getting in*<P>"84... Really?"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> <BR>A woman at a gas station<P>"Ohhh, the engine is back there"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif"><BR>same woman at the gas station a moment later<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tiggerblue4.gif"> <BR>T-T-F-N, Ta Ta For Now!<BR><A HREF="http://www.fortunecity.com/tatooine/spielberg/241/" TARGET=_blank>Tigger's Fiero Page</A>||||reg||7
