Z||000013||Rick 88||09-19-2001||02:46 AM||||These are some comments on my Fiero:<P>"That can't be the stock muffler, it sounds too good."  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>"You sure did a nice job painting your motor red" (original factory paint)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>"I didn't know the brake calipers said Fiero on them" (thanks Rodney) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>"They copied the flexible panels on the Saturn" (Duhhh) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif"><P>This is one of my favorites from a friend with a nice LT-4 Corvette: "It sure has a lot of room inside, and it rides much better than my Vette....but i'll still kick your A$$.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>Rick <BR>yellow 88 GT 5-speed||||reg||1
Z||000014||onfire||09-19-2001||03:09 AM||||The response I always get when I tell people its a Fiero. "Why did you buy one of those?" <BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/onfiresig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
