Z||000017||gusto||09-19-2001||05:35 PM||||Every family member who has seen my car has had the same response:  "You dont have to worry about me asking to drive it"                                           My mother and one brother says its to small,(I'm bigger than both of them though,6"1 230lbs)  My other brother is scared it will catch on fire,(when we were younger a cousin's friend had one that did.) And my cousin just thinks it looks ugly.||||reg||1
